  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "類比積體電路",
    "sub_ename": "ANALOG INTEGRATED CIRCUIT",
    "describe_ch": "在過去二十年來，CMOS技術已快速的涵蓋了類比積體電路的範圍，且提供低成本高效能的解決方案並成為市場主流。對於今日複雜的混合訊號系統的積體化而言，只有CMOS製程是可行的選擇。針對類比CMOS積體電路的分析與設計，同時強調基礎以及學生今日必須精通熟悉的新範例。類比積體電路設計需要直覺和精確。因此每個觀念將先由直覺概念導入，然後再仔細分析。本課程的目的在徹底了解基本觀念及分析電路的方式，使學生能學習到在何種電路下能使用何種近似法及在每種近似法下能預測到的誤差。",
    "describe_eh": " In the past two decades, CMOS technology has rapidly embraced the field of analog integrated circuits, providing low-cost, high-performance solutions and rising to dominate the market. Only CMOS processes have emerged as viable choice for the integration of today's complex mixed signal systems. In accordance with the analysis and design of analog CMOS integrated circuits, emphasizing fundamentals as well as new paradigms that student need to master in today's industry. Since analog design requires both intuition and rigor, each concept is first introduced from an intuitive perspective and subsequently treated by careful analysis. The objective is to develop both a solid foundation and methods of analyzing circuits by inspection so that the student what approximations can be made in which circuits and how much error to expect in each approximation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能知道類比積體電路分析和設計的基本觀念。",
      "describe_en": "To know the basic concept about analog integrated circuit design and analysis.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能理解各種operational amplifier 之操作原理及電路設計的方法與技。",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension of the principle and circuit design of various operational amplifiers."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "能辨識出可應用類比積體電路理論、模型與模擬的場合，並能清楚表達。",
      "describe_en": "Can distinguish out and make clear statement where theory, model and simulation of analog integrated circuits can be applied."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能使用相關數學技術，完成一個類比積體電路的分析和設計計算程序，並由計算中歸納出適當的結論。",
      "describe_en": "Can use relevant mathematics technology  to complete the computational procedure for the analysis and design of analog integrated circuit, and is summed up the proper conclusion while calculating."
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "describe_ch": "知道於何處可找到類比積體電路議題的相關資訊、研究結果及標準，並可評估所獲資訊的適用性。",
      "describe_en": "Know where to locate and access related analog integrated circuits issue information, research, as well as standards, and be able to evaluate the appropriateness of the obtained information."
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "describe_ch": "能利用類比積體電路的原理，評估一個類比積體電路系統，並提出計算程序。",
      "describe_en": "Can use principles of analog integrated circuits to evaluate an integrated circuits system and propose a feasible method for computational algorithms."
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "describe_ch": "能以書面或口頭方式將所獲結果與同儕、助教及教師溝通。",
      "describe_en": "Can communicate results in written or oral form to classmates, teaching assistants, and the instructor."
    }
  ],
